<h3 align="center">You wake up inside Ricky Monsales’s GitHub profile.</h3>

<p align="center">
  <i>It’s late. A monitor hums on the desk. A cat watches you from the rug.<br/>
  Somewhere outside, it’s Bogo City, Cebu. There are five things worth looking at.</i>
</p>

<p align="center"><b>What do you do?</b> <sub>(click to choose)</sub></p>

---

<details>
<summary><b>🖥️ &nbsp;Look at the monitor</b></summary>
<br/>

> The screen glows teal. Someone left mid-thought — a cursor blinks at the end of a half-written function.
> The file tabs say this person builds **full stack web apps**: the parts you click, and the parts you don’t see.

These are the tools scattered across the desk:

