</p>

<details>
<summary><b>🔍 &nbsp;Lean in closer</b></summary>
<br/>

> You squint at the corner of the screen. There’s a little dashboard of numbers.

<p>
  <img height="160" src="https://github-readme-stats.vercel.app/api?username=rikimaruu333&show_icons=true&bg_color=2b2140&title_color=ffb35c&text_color=e9e2f5&icon_color=6fe0d0&border_color=43304f&border_radius=6" alt="GitHub stats" />
