</p>

> 🏅 *You found: the stats.*

</details>
</details>

<details>
<summary><b>🪟 &nbsp;Open the window</b></summary>
<br/>

> Warm air drifts in. You can smell the sea.
> This is **Bogo City, Cebu, Philippines** — <code>UTC+8</code>. If you message at night your time, it’s probably morning here.

- 🌏 Open to remote work and collaborations
- 🕗 Usually online in Philippine time

> 🏅 *You found: the location.*

</details>

<details>
<summary><b>🎮 &nbsp;Pick up the controller</b></summary>
<br/>

> It’s still warm. Someone was in the middle of a game.
> When Ricky isn’t coding, he’s probably playing something — he’ll tell you building worlds and building apps scratch the same itch.

<details>
<summary><b>▶️ &nbsp;Press START</b></summary>
<br/>

> The monitor flickers. A line of text appears:
>
> <code>CONTINUE? &nbsp;▸ YES &nbsp;&nbsp;NO</code>
>
> You choose YES. You always choose YES.

> 🏅 *You found: the secret save file.*

</details>
</details>

<details>
<summary><b>📌 &nbsp;Read the sticky note</b></summary>
<br/>

> It’s stuck to the shelf, slightly crooked, in handwriting that was clearly in a hurry:
>
> ### “Learn to code? No. Code to learn.”

Underneath, smaller: *make it beautiful, make it work, make it easy for people.*

> 🏅 *You found: the motto.*

</details>

<details>
<summary><b>🐈 &nbsp;Pet the cat</b></summary>
<br/>

> The cat allows it. Barely.
> It stands, stretches, and walks to the door — as if to say *you’ve seen enough, go talk to him.*

<details>
<summary><b>🚪 &nbsp;Follow the cat out</b></summary>
<br/>

> On the way out, you pick up a few things:

| Item | Use it |
|---|---|
| 📮 A business card | [LinkedIn](https://www.linkedin.com/in/YOUR-LINKEDIN) |
| 🐦 A paper bird | [X / Twitter](https://x.com/wwwricksxm) |
| 📷 A polaroid | [Instagram](https://instagram.com/wricks.m) |
| ✉️ A postcard | [Facebook](https://facebook.com/YOUR-FACEBOOK) |

> 🏅 *You found: the way out.*
>
> **Thanks for playing.** If you found all five 🏅, you know Ricky better than most recruiters do.

</details>
</details>

